            <div xml:id="d423">

                <pb facs="0457" n="445" xml:id="pg445"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">835.796/271: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Caffery</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de
                                Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1942-06-24T18:00:00-03:00">June 24, 1942—6
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 6:25 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2193. Buenos Aires’ 1216, June 23, 11 p.m., to Department. Aranha tells me that
                    he will not let the Argentine have the Lati planes.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
